{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございまーす！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...意外と普通に始まってみた(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車のアナウンスで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『マナーモードに設定して』が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『バナナモードに設定して』に聞こえました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田\nバナナモードなう｀・ω・´にょーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お好み焼きは広島風か関西風どっちが好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nどっちにも良さがあるから\nお好み焼きに広島風と関西風があるのだ。\nだから選べないよー＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でチャーハン作る？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n家で一人のときは作りますよー＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"告知します"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/1588452/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PON\n日本テレビ系10:25〜11:25\nギリギリの告知ですみません(;_;)\n生放送でおいでシャンプー披露です！\n楽しみにしててください(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/1588452/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TVstation\nいこまちゃん、れいか、まいやん、ななみん、中田\nの5人が載ってます(*・ω・)ノ\n見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪からの帰りのバスが\nまりちゃと隣だったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、スタッフさんが\n布団変わりにベンチコートを\nみんなに貸してくれたんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃのベンチコートの使い方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/1588452/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だ、だ、抱き枕！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いすぎて吐血したのは\n中田だけではないはず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んじゃ、\n今日も１日頑張りましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、\n終わらせないぜ〜！←←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！\n今日は\nおいでシャンプーの発売日です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテンのPVの時は\nせっかく選抜に選んでいただいたのに\n顔が映るより後頭部のが出演していたりで←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田推しのみなさんを\nがっかりさせることが多かったと思うけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は\n初めてこんなにPVにもCMにも\n番組にも雑誌にも\n出させていただいて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またすぐ\n3rdの選抜発表もあるだろうから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネガティブみたいだけど\n現実的に考えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなこと\nこれからいつまたあるかわかんないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ないかもしれないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田なりに精一杯頑張ってるんで\n『おいでシャンプー』は大切な曲です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/02/1588452/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}